Okay, here's my great scheme for getting your AC as low as you want.  First,
give all your gold to the priest in 400*exp increments.  Then when you
are zorkmid-less, #chat with the priest and he (or she, as the case may
be) will give you two bits for an ale.  Drop this money, and #chat again.
Keep doing this until you have all your money back.  Then offer it all to
the priest again.  If you set up a macro to do this, and leave it on all
night, your AC could be pretty low by morning.  (Anyone want to do the
calculations?)

You could call it cheating, but it IS within the scope of the game.

In any case, I haven't tried it.  (It was setting up the macro that
thwarted me.)

